An unterminated fence at a content column opens no block, so the paragraph stays open

````
- q
  ```
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>q
    <pre><code></code></pre>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
````

````
:: t
:  a
   ```
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>a</p>
    <pre><code></code></pre>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
````

